WEBVTT

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:01.306
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>Will</b>

00:00:02.959 --> 00:00:07.807
<v><b>Will:</b></v> My favourite meal of the day is lunch. I’m always hungry then.

00:00:08.613 --> 00:00:12.439
I have lunch at work – we have a canteen there.

00:00:13.626 --> 00:00:19.793
I have different things for lunch but always with chips – I love chips.

00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:24.650
Sometimes a burger and chips, sometimes fish and chips.

00:00:25.352 --> 00:00:31.867
I drink water with my lunch but after lunch I have a coffee, an espresso.

00:00:33.949 --> 00:00:34.712
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>Sarah</b>

00:00:36.445 --> 00:00:39.086
<v><b>Sarah:</b></v> My favourite meal is breakfast.

00:00:39.588 --> 00:00:45.344
I usually have it at home, but on Wednesday I have my yoga class

00:00:45.546 --> 00:00:49.011
and I have breakfast at a café near the yoga studio.

00:00:50.030 --> 00:00:55.348
At home I have fruit and an egg, and coffee or tea.

00:00:56.110 --> 00:01:00.437
But at the café I have a croissant and hot chocolate.